{
 "_doc": "Materials the native renderers draw with, by name (native/src/render/render_context.h). Colours as '#rrggbb', textures as res:// paths. prop lens_roughness and lens_ior: the signal lens, polished polycarbonate (Physically Based database, physicallybased.info, 'Plastic (PC)': roughness 0, index of refraction 1.5848 from refractiveindex.info). Vegetation wind (vegetation.gdshaderinc): wind_speed_ms 3 = Beaufort 2, light breeze 1.6-3.3 m/s (WMO); sway_per_ms2 = top bend per (m/s)^2 from Peltola et al. 1993 (crown-centre bending under 5 cm on a 13.5 m pine at 8 m/s: 0.0037 of the height, times (1/0.6)^2 to the top, over 64); gust_m = 22 x 10 m (Kaimal et al. 1972 spectral peak n z / U = 1/22); turbulence = 1 / ln(10 m / 0.05 m) (EN 1991-1-4 eq. 4.7, terrain category II); sway_hz = natural frequency of leafy trees of 8-15 m, 0.2-0.3 Hz (Jackson et al. 2019).",
